{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295160","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029516001:2":{"text":"サジタリス様！また会えてうれしいです！でもあなたが来たってことは……","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯大人！很高兴见到您！但是您出现的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B9EE3F39515AF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029516002:1":{"text":"おや？我の姿を見てもっと驚くと思ったんだがなぁ。","source_cn":"嗯？我以为见到我你们会更惊喜一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CB6332ADD0EA33D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029516003:1":{"text":"驚いてはいますが……さすがに月の神の財宝を届けに来た訳ではないでしょう……？","source_cn":"是很惊喜……但是您出现的话，应该不是来给送月神的宝藏吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37065B7EB3D703F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029516004:1":{"text":"月の神の財宝？確かにそんな物はない。","source_cn":"月神的宝藏？我这里确实没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDD474727881205B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029516005:1":{"text":"今回も愉快な旅を経験したようだが、どうやら結果に満足していないようだな？","source_cn":"看来你们又经历了一段不错的旅程，但是对结果似乎不够满意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9279A2D8207F14E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029516006:1":{"text":"アリアから月の神の財宝に関する伝説を教えてもらったんです。それで色々調べたら、謎かけを解けば泉が現れて中に財宝があると聞いて……","source_cn":"阿莉雅告诉我们月神宝藏的传说，我们打听到了解开谜题就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694F32F6E8720B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1029516006":{"text":"アリアから月の神の財宝に関する伝説を教えてもらったんです。それで色々調べたら、謎かけを解けば泉が現れて中に財宝があると聞いて……","source_cn":"阿莉雅告诉我们月神宝藏的传说，我们打听到了解开谜题就能召唤出泉眼。而水中就隐藏着月神的宝藏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694F32F6E8720B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029516007:1":{"text":"真実か否か、それは人それぞれの捉え方次第だ。","source_cn":"真与假，只是不同人的于己之见的不同观点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CCD33B724D3FB38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029516008:1":{"text":"お前たちにしてみれば、泉は現れたが財宝はなかった、それは予想と違っていた、だから伝説は嘘だった。","source_cn":"或许对你们而言，泉水涌出没有带来宝藏，这与你们预期不同...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48CE66872774549C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029516009:2":{"text":"だが我にしてみれば、数年もの時を経て、月の神殿という舞台が、再び二つの泉によって美しく彩られた。","source_cn":"但于我而言，时隔数年，月神殿这一隅舞台终于又被两处泉眼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6E3A275938A72F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029516010:1":{"text":"これでまた新たな演目が観れるし作れる、まさに至宝だよ。","source_cn":"我可以再次或观看或导演新的剧目，这已是至宝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E57570770D58319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029516011:1":{"text":"月の神の財宝は手に入らぬが、我のお気に入りのエールを振る舞ってやろう、どうだ？","source_cn":"你们无法拿到月神的宝藏，但却可以获得我的心爱之物，我请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC391DEF0A9127E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029516012:2":{"text":"はいはい！飲みたいです！","source_cn":"我要我要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16F2E833F340829B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"月の神の財宝は嘘だった。","source_cn":"月神宝藏的传说是假的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21E68DE255E7401D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"月の神の財宝は嘘だった。","female":"月の神の財宝は嘘だった。","variant_male_record_index":"62792","variant_female_record_index":"62793","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"謎かけを解いたら確かに泉が現れた。","source_cn":"解开谜题确实能唤起泉眼","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCF268FA068F150","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"謎かけを解いたら確かに泉が現れた。","female":"謎かけを解いたら確かに泉が現れた。","variant_male_record_index":"62794","variant_female_record_index":"62795","document_title":"",